                                                "sense_id": "db474645-75a2-3149-b7d6-8424a9315619",
                                                "text": "He attended every Monday night show at Skipper's, where he knew everyone and everyone knew him. Here he was affectionately called \"Ed Head\" and was famous for being the most sophisticated cocksucker anywhere — the fabulous GTX, \"Golden Throated Extra.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
